    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/f81ab602e80deb4e1c6f1986d1d6c431.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/08c3f019457109ea05d02a54cb78785d.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic accident, <strong>Kiro and Chloe</strong> are suddenly separated after spending nearly their entire lives together. This leaves <strong>Kiro</strong> completely weakened and causes <strong>Chloe</strong> to fall ill. <strong>Kiro</strong> must find a way to reach <strong>Chloe</strong> again to save them both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/d03f3dea8797a78d852d29901eb9f707.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Soul Link</strong> is a delicate, symbiotic, natural, and spiritual bond between a human and an animal species. It is a connection where both beings share sensations, emotions, and the same vital essence, without losing their individuality or sense of thought. Not much is known about the Soul Link. Scientists continue to make new discoveries every day. However, they remain unaware that the key to understanding this phenomenon lies buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/a329f9adc4e883f7166e0f9392630ba9.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span><strong>Kiro can equip swords, armor, magic, and special abilities.</strong> TIES: Soul Link features a slot-based ability system that allows for deep customization, encouraging players to embrace their preferred playstyle. His primary weapon is the sword, and he\u2019ll have access to a wide variety of models that increase attack power, add elemental effects, and adapt to different types of enemies. He can also wear armor to protect himself from damage and gain resistance or advantages against certain types of magic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equippable magic, called <strong>&quot;Runes,&quot;</strong> can be swapped out to create combinations that best suit each player\u2019s strategy. As his journey unfolds, Kiro will also unlock new abilities hidden throughout the vast world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/c2be41534429c3c746d1491e6bdd1a5c.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span>The year is 2097. Four decades have passed since humanity managed to survive the effects of climate change. Now, people are forging a path through a new world shaped by nature and machines. Embark on a journey through unique cities, where <strong>urban cyberpunk landscapes</strong> blend with Norse ruins, Japanese culture, Greek mythology, and Persian influences. Discover hidden routes and secret areas filled with lore, collectibles, and puzzles that will challenge your mind and enhance your abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each city also features <strong>shops and establishments</strong> where you can buy, sell, or upgrade gear, recover health, or simply relax and interact with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/0f446d05e7978f8a2d4f2c17f3420f8f.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/ba3b55980507636672c59c264c958340.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span>On his epic journey, Kiro will uncover the lost wisdom of the old world, knowledge that holds the answers to the mysteries of the future. But this journey demands more than discoveries: it will force you to make choices that define his fate. Get ready, <strong>Kiro will do whatever it takes to save his best friend.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6c2582e1ae90d349f4182ee96a686117.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/26ac133e9753581be01a06fb558d1c24.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/f81ab602e80deb4e1c6f1986d1d6c431.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/08c3f019457109ea05d02a54cb78785d.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragic accident, <strong>Kiro and Chloe</strong> are suddenly separated after spending nearly their entire lives together. This leaves <strong>Kiro</strong> completely weakened and causes <strong>Chloe</strong> to fall ill. <strong>Kiro</strong> must find a way to reach <strong>Chloe</strong> again to save them both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/d03f3dea8797a78d852d29901eb9f707.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6144e5943c8ca2fee4601da132f1ca2d.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Soul Link</strong> is a delicate, symbiotic, natural, and spiritual bond between a human and an animal species. It is a connection where both beings share sensations, emotions, and the same vital essence, without losing their individuality or sense of thought. Not much is known about the Soul Link. Scientists continue to make new discoveries every day. However, they remain unaware that the key to understanding this phenomenon lies buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/a329f9adc4e883f7166e0f9392630ba9.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span><strong>Kiro can equip swords, armor, magic, and special abilities.</strong> TIES: Soul Link features a slot-based ability system that allows for deep customization, encouraging players to embrace their preferred playstyle. His primary weapon is the sword, and he\u2019ll have access to a wide variety of models that increase attack power, add elemental effects, and adapt to different types of enemies. He can also wear armor to protect himself from damage and gain resistance or advantages against certain types of magic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/036107c95b93720c2550357d398044ae.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equippable magic, called <strong>&quot;Runes,&quot;</strong> can be swapped out to create combinations that best suit each player\u2019s strategy. As his journey unfolds, Kiro will also unlock new abilities hidden throughout the vast world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/c2be41534429c3c746d1491e6bdd1a5c.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span>The year is 2097. Four decades have passed since humanity managed to survive the effects of climate change. Now, people are forging a path through a new world shaped by nature and machines. Embark on a journey through unique cities, where <strong>urban cyberpunk landscapes</strong> blend with Norse ruins, Japanese culture, Greek mythology, and Persian influences. Discover hidden routes and secret areas filled with lore, collectibles, and puzzles that will challenge your mind and enhance your abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.poster.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.webm?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/16ccc3acb235a3f0d14425a38d6811d0.mp4?t=1754389496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each city also features <strong>shops and establishments</strong> where you can buy, sell, or upgrade gear, recover health, or simply relax and interact with the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/0f446d05e7978f8a2d4f2c17f3420f8f.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/ba3b55980507636672c59c264c958340.webp?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=41 /></span>On his epic journey, Kiro will uncover the lost wisdom of the old world, knowledge that holds the answers to the mysteries of the future. But this journey demands more than discoveries: it will force you to make choices that define his fate. Get ready, <strong>Kiro will do whatever it takes to save his best friend.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/6c2582e1ae90d349f4182ee96a686117.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600730/extras/26ac133e9753581be01a06fb558d1c24.avif?t=1754389496\" width=600 height=122 /></span></p>",
